WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:03.752
Add money: from your verified account at another bank

2
00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:06.371
Enter how much to pull in

3
00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:08.615
Review it

4
00:00:08.616 --> 00:00:12.655
Confirm it is you: the second step names the top-up

5
00:00:12.676 --> 00:00:14.887
A second person in your company approves it before the bank pulls the money

6
00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:18.908
The approver approves, with their own second step

7
00:00:18.911 --> 00:00:21.519
Approved: the bank pulls the money by ACH
